: "CR Text"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 2, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [394.75872802734375, 435.5741882324219], "pos": [1499.013427734375, 328.8745422363281], "widgets_values": ["抱歉，我无法直接生成或编辑12格分镜图的图片，但我可以为您提供详细的12格分镜图描述。以下是具体的创意内容描述：\n\n---\n\n### **第一部分：创意内容描述 (Creative Content Brief)**\n\n| 标题 | 内容 |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **项目名称** | 旺仔牛奶马年限定版广告分镜 |\n| **分镜总格数** | 12格 (3x4) |\n| **总体风格** | 黑白、高对比度、手绘线稿 |\n\n**【分镜图内容列表 (Shot List)】**\n\n| 编号 | 画面描述 (Visual/Action) | 镜头/景别 (Shot Type) | 旁白/对话/文字 (Narration/Text) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 1 | 一个温暖的中国传统客厅，充满春节装饰，红灯笼、中国结、倒贴的“福”字。 | 全景 (Wide Shot) | （旁白）“新春到，团圆时刻！” |\n| 2 | 小男孩穿着红色唐装，蹦跳着跑进画面，脸上带着兴奋的笑容。 | 中景 (Medium Shot) | （旁白）“旺仔牛奶陪你欢喜过大年！” |\n| 3 | 男孩双手高举“旺仔牛奶马年限定版”铁罐，罐身特写清晰显示旺仔和生肖马图案。 | 特写 (Close-up) | （男孩）“旺旺旺！好运马上来！” |\n| 4 | 爷爷奶奶在背景微笑着看着男孩，伸手递出红包。 | 中景 (Medium Shot) | （旁白）“团聚的时刻，分享喜悦！” |\n| 5 | 桌上摆满了丰盛的年夜饭，旺仔牛奶罐子被摆在正中间。 | 俯拍 (Top Shot) | （旁白）“旺仔牛奶，团圆的味道。” |\n| 6 | 小男孩和家人一起举杯庆祝，笑声洋溢满屋。 | 中景 (Medium Shot) | （旁白）“每罐旺仔牛奶，都是满满幸福！” |\n| 7 | 小男孩打开铁罐，喝了一口，露出满足的表情。 | 特写 (Close-up) | （男孩）“真好喝！” |\n| 8 | 镜头切换到外景，烟花在夜空中绽放，屋内灯火通明。 | 全景 (Wide Shot) | （旁白）“新年新希望，旺仔陪你旺旺旺！” |\n| 9 | 镜头回到客厅，旺仔牛奶罐被放在茶几上，旁边是一副对联。 | 特写 (Close-up) | （旁白）“品旺仔，旺福气！” |\n| 10 | 小男孩和家人一起看春晚，背景电视画面模糊。 | 中景 (Medium Shot) | （旁白）“团圆时刻，少不了旺仔牛奶！” |\n| 11 | 镜头缓缓拉远，全家人其乐融融，欢声笑语不断。 | 全景 (Wide Shot) | （旁白）“旺仔牛奶，陪你迎接新年！” |\n| 12 | 旺仔牛奶马年限定版铁罐占据画面中央，背景是金色烟花和红色灯笼装饰，旁边出现广告标语。 | 特写 (Close-Up) | **“旺仔牛奶，旺旺过马年！”** |\n\n---\n\n### **第二部分：生成的黑白分镜图 (Generated Storyboard)**\n\n**【提示生成指令 (Prompt for Image Generation)】**：\n\n\"Generate a 12-frame storyboard in black-and-white ink sketch style. Follow the descriptions below for each frame:  \n1. Wide shot: A traditional Chinese living room decorated with red lanterns, a Chinese knot, and an upside-down 'Fu' character.  \n2. Medium shot: A boy in a red Tang suit runs into the frame, smiling joyfully.  \n3. Close-up: The boy holds up the special edition 'Wangzai Milk' can with the zodiac horse design.  \n4. Medium shot: Grandparents smile in the background, handing red envelopes.  \n5. Top shot: A table filled with New Year’s dishes, with the milk can prominently displayed in the center.  \n6. Medium shot: The boy and family toast together, laughing.  \n7. Close-up: The boy drinks from the can, showing a satisfied expression.  \n8. Wide shot: Fireworks light up the night sky, with a warmly lit house in the background.  \n9. Close-up: The milk can is placed on the coffee table, next to a couplet.  \n10. Medium shot: The family watches a Spring Festival Gala on TV, smiling.  \n11. Wide shot: The family enjoys their time together, surrounded by festive decorations.  \n12. Close-up: The special edition 'Wangzai Milk' can in the center, with golden fireworks and red lanterns in the background, accompanied by the slogan: 'Wangzai Milk: Celebrate the Year of the Horse!'  \n\nEnsure the storyboard has a 4x3 grid layout, high contrast, dynamic ink sketch lines, and a festive atmosphere.\""], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 3, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [1, 7, 17], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [270, 314.0000305175781], "pos": [-233.150634765625, 1082.5560302734375], "widgets_values": ["e6825d613a44db57824ef392c79a2c1683585462f1cea3f20110622aad0982db.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_u